<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῡμι-άω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθυμίησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippon.
					92
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.97
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				Ion.
			fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.126
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθυμιησάμην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				7
			</span></i> (but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ασάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.27
				</span></i>
			):—
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ᾱθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.68.6
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐθυμιάθην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>:—<i>burn so as to produce smoke</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. τὴν στύρακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.107
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβανωτοῦ τριηκόσια τάλαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.99
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάνου δάκρυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					122.4
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>burn incense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				264
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				22.17
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				352.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> in
			honour of any one, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.289f
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				12.51
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be burnt</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σπέρμα
				τῆς καννάβιος] θυμιᾶται</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆται</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος . . τεθυμιαμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					635
				</span></i>
			; <i>pass off in fumes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				362a11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιωμένων τινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					66d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>smoke, fumigate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.2970
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, Hp.ll.cc.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιώμεναι μέλισσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					623b20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>smoke</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρακες θυμιῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Ign.</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			.</div>
